preConditionHook:
// Two successive net moves of equal length: the last legBars bars against the
// legBars before them. Both are plain fixed-offset closes, so nothing here is
// stateful and nothing reads the position -- the generator's own
// MarketPosition guard on the exit is what makes the long side apply to a long
// and the short side to a short, which is why the merged pseudocode's
// MarketPosition term is not repeated here (StopLoss and AtrProfitTarget omit
// it for the same reason).
recentLeg = close[0] - close[legBars];
priorLeg = close[legBars] - close[2 * legBars];
